{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1399031-chicago-by-night-v1-v5-what-would-happen-if-alexis-survived","id":1399031,"title":"[Chicago by Night V1-V5] What would happen if Alexis survived?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-06-26T05:18:40-07:00","id":1399031,"title":"[Chicago by Night V1-V5] What would happen if Alexis survived?","content":"Alexis clearly had Protean 3 if you believe what Marc Levasque hopes for.<br /> <br /> We know that Balthazar drove a stake into Alexis and could not allow his childe to die. But what if Balthazar did not hit his Sire's heart and that she was burned by the flames but just before final death she used her last blood in order to crawl to the earth cellar and melded with the ground and there went into torpor.<br /> <br /> I am playing with the idea that Alexis had another Childe than Balthazar and this child in turn got another and this grandchilde of Alexis became a PC's sire. What if Alexis now in torpor tried to get in touch with the PC through the use of summon and vague dreams/visions if he finds the place where it happened. <br /> <br /> She will clearly need blood in order to rise, so the player might have to pour human/kindred blood into the ground as a &quot;ritual&quot; in order for her to soak it up and awaken from torpor to rise up. <br /> <br /> What would you see happen in Chicago?<br /> * At first i take it she would need to get her strength back up so that she can heal all the aggrevated wounds from the fire and then she needs to relearn everything in order to not get lost in time.<br /> * Would she contact Modius or does she blame him?<br /> * Will she take out her revenge on Balthazar or will she just accept that he is a prick and move on<br /> * How would Marc feel?<br /> * Would she be unbalancing everything in Chicago?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>This space for rent.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25995-ethryo","name":"Ethryo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"67"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-26T05:26:40-07:00","id":1399032,"title":"","content":"I imagine there will be the stereotypical period of adjustment where she has to deal with the fact she's lost nearly a hundred years of life.<br /> <br /> 1. Being a Brujah, her first goal will undoubtedly be to reclaim her control over Marc Levesque as he is her most prominent tie to the current century. The fact that she Blood Bound him and he's like, &quot;Oh, no, we were really in love&quot; to me gives me insight into the idea that she's probably an abusive elder the same as just about any other. I see Anita being horrified if Alexis tries to reinstitute the Blood Bond over him [it's undoubtedly weakened to the point of nothingness] and trying to &quot;save him.&quot; Marc might go along with it because he &quot;loves&quot; Alexis.<br /> <br /> 2. I think Alexis will probably dismiss Modius as having completely failed and gone insane after one look at the guy.<br /> <br /> 3. Alexis is a former Prince herself and may attempt to take over the Anarch Movement to try to seize praxis from Kevin Jackson. Being a Camarilla Elder, she'd probably see his young age as a weakness.<br /> <br /> 4. Undoubtedly, I think she'd try to kill Balthazar. The same would be true in reverse. Mind you, the two might actually make common cause if you want to be REALLY cynical about how vampire relationships work.<br /> <br /> &quot;I don't like you and you don't like me but you can be Sheriff again if you help me murder Prince Jackson.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Will you honor that promise?&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Yes, but I'll undoubtedly betray you in other ways.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Fair enough.&quot;<br /> <br /> 5. I imagine Alexis would very much take advantage of the socialist revival and Left leaning political movements of Chicago to her advantage. We might see an Ocasio-Cortez-esque politician or Bernie type becoming her tools as she challenges the traditional Chicago Status quo.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 06-26-2020, 08:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-26T05:45:08-07:00","id":1399036,"title":"","content":"It's quite possible that Alexis had other progeny, so you could absolutely have a PC in the line of another progeny of Alexis. In addition to CT's excellent suggestions, there might other possibilities. Having a childe stake her and nearly suffering Final Death, perhaps she takes a more secretive or paranoid approach? Maybe she gathers her other brood and becomes a hidden master of an anarch coterie? Revenge against Balthazar would be high on her priority, which means, at times, it may appear she's acting against other anarchs- in truth, she's foiling Balthazar.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24582-ruthven","name":"Ruthven","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"118"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}